# W7g, guest b (k2): while a's link flaps it plays on near (442,-10) (W7b's spot: its wander towards (-150,-60) crosses stag0101's
# rock slope, which a k2 character does not survive). The END comes when the debt-shortened grace of a's close ends (about @278), HOME
